WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.640
Wondering how much a revenue-based&nbsp;
funding option could cost your business?

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:10.240
Let’s break it down in a way that’s easy to&nbsp;
understand—and could save you a lot of headaches!

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:16.640
When it comes to revenue-based funding, the cost&nbsp;
is based on a unique rate called a ‘factor rate.’

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:20.680
Think of this as the magic number that&nbsp;
determines how much you’ll pay back.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:28.120
Factor rates typically range from 1.18 to&nbsp;
1.55—but what does that really mean for you?

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:31.680
Let’s say your business is approved for $30,000.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:38.960
Depending on your factor rate, your repayment&nbsp;
could range between $35,400 and $46,500.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:48.120
Yep, that’s $5,400 to $16,500 extra,&nbsp;
all determined by your factor rate.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:52.000
Now you might be asking:&nbsp;
‘What factor rate will I get?’

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.600
Well, that depends on how strong&nbsp;
your business performance is.

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:58.120
The better your numbers, the better your rate!

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.000
But wait, there’s more!

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.440
Some funding providers might&nbsp;
include an origination fee,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:08.920
which is like a setup charge ranging&nbsp;
anywhere from 0-5% of the advance amount.

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:15.560
On a $30,000 advance, that’s an&nbsp;
extra $0 to $1,500 right off the top!

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:18.080
Since not all providers include this fee,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:22.440
it’s crucial to verify with your&nbsp;
provider whether they do or not.

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:26.200
After all, it’s better to know&nbsp;
upfront before agreeing or signing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:30.240
anything than to find out later—when&nbsp;
it’s too late to change your mind!

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:35.840
Ultimately, here’s the bottom line: revenue-based&nbsp;
funding can be a lifeline for many businesses,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:39.760
but knowing the real cost is key&nbsp;
to making the right decision.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:43.520
The better informed you are, the&nbsp;
better you can plan for success.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:44.840
Got questions?

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:47.760
Drop them in the comments,&nbsp;
and let’s chat about it!

